1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,200
1945 · San Francisco

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,700
Preamble, Charter of the United Nations

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,400
We the Peoples of the United Nations,
determined...

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:10,400
7,030 living languages

5
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:11,900
One dot, one language.

6
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:14,600
Most AI interfaces
list only a dozen.

7
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,600
This is not a technical problem.
It is a choice.

8
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:21,600
So we put every language
in the interface.

9
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:24,400
White. UN blue.
Peacekeeping. The Charter.

10
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:26,400
It looks like the UN.
It still works like DSH.

11
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:29,200
Six peacekeeping photographs, slowly rotating.
Each one credited: photographer, licence, contributing country.

12
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:31,200
The United Nations thanks you
for your service and sacrifice.

13
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:34,600
It adds one button.
Every existing control, untouched.

14
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:39,600
A place for every language.
